 ridge with fog,\nand made the sky above so dense\nthat the pregnant air changed to water.\nRain fell, and whatever the earth couldn't absorb\nflowed into the gullies.\nAs it merged with the mighty torrents,\nit rushed headlong toward the royal river\nwith such speed that nothing could stop it.\nThe swollen Archiano found my frozen body\nnear its mouth, swept it into the Arno,\nand loosened from my chest the cross\nI'd made with my arms when pain overcame me.\nIt rolled me along banks and bottom,\nthen covered and wrapped me with its debris.","startTime":229.28,"endTime":321.36,"words":[{"word":"At","start":229.28,"end":229.48},{"word":"the","start":229.48,"end":229.6},{"word":"foot","start":229.6,"end":229.8},{"word":"of","start":229.8,"end":229.92},{"word":"the","start":229.92,"end":230},{"word":"Casentino,","start":230,"end":231.28},{"word":"flows","start":231.28,"end":231.48},{"word":"a","start":231.48,"end":231.6},{"word":"river","start":231.6,"end":231.92},{"word":"called","start":231.92,"end":232.2},{"word":"the","start":232.2,"end":232.32},{"word":"Archiano,","start":232.32,"end":233.56},{"word":"born","start":233.56,"end":233.76},{"word":"above","start":233.76,"end":234.04},{"word":"the","start":234.04,"end":234.16},{"word":"hermitage","start":234.16,"end":234.68},{"word":"in","start":234.68,"end":234.76},{"word":"the","start":234.76,"end":234.88},{"word":"Apennines.","start":234.88,"end":236.24},{"word":"Where","start":236.24,"end":236.48},{"word":"that","start":236.48,"end":236.72},{"word":"river","start":236.72,"end":237.04},{"word":"loses","start":237.04,"end":237.44},{"word":"its","start":237.44,"end":237.6},{"word":"name,","start":237.6,"end":238.32},{"word":"I","start":238.32,"end":238.52},{"word":"arrived","start":238.52,"end":238.96},{"word":"with","start":238.96,"end":239.16},{"word":"my","start":239.16,"end":239.44},{"word":"throat","start":239.44,"end":239.76},{"word":"pierced","start":239.76,"end":240.16},{"word":"through,","start":240.16,"end"